{"ticker":"GODREJAGRO","symbol":"GODREJAGRO","instrumentId":3153200,"name":"Godrej Agrovet","industry":"NSE-Food-Meat Products","about":"Godrej Agrovet Ltd. is a leading agribusiness company in India, operating across various segments including animal feed, crop protection, dairy, poultry, and palm oil plantations. The company provides high-quality animal feed for cattle, poultry, and aquaculture, as well as innovative crop protection products that help farmers improve yield and reduce costs. Its dairy segment offers a range of fresh and processed milk products, while the palm oil business focuses on sustainable plantation practices. Godrej Agrovet emphasizes research and development to deliver advanced farming solutions that boost productivity, enhance farm incomes, and support India’s agriculture sector with sustainable and innovative practices.","website":"www.godrejagrovet.com","location":"INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:23:03.943Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":580.1,"changePct":-1.711284310403257,"week52High":676.05,"week52Low":513},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹11,162 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹10,901 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"61,571,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"129"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"23,410,001"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"1.90%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"5.49"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.7"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"40.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.02"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.87"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"7%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"23.77"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"25–42"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"23.3%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"66.64"},{"label":"Volume","value":"52,909"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"178,278"},{"label":"Master score","value":"49"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"53"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"56"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"